April 2001.

This dir contains source tree for ext2sim and ext2spice.
This programs are shipped with Max.

ORIGIN
------
root version is Magic version 'max' (kiw:~mha/magic/max)

Magic versions:
644/	- release 6.4.4
644.mmi	- 6.4.4 with mmi mods	
645/	- release 6.4.5
645.jul30	-	6.4.5 with Jeffrey Gealow's patches
wrl/	- wrl code fragments. (good drc stuff)
mmi/	- 645.jul30 with mmi patches
max/	- derivitive of mmi/, being used to build ext2sim and ext2spice
	  for Max (Sep 99).

CHANGE LOG
----------
For changes since root version, see CHANGE_LOG. 
